        "created_at": "2021-04-28T09:01:37.910Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I stopped listening to the Letters Page right before they did the OblivAeon episode, because I didn’t want to get spoiled on what happens in the game before I played it… and I still haven’t played it. It’s weird to think how long ago that was. apparently that was the last character episode they did until now?</p>\n<p>I’m glad this is the sort of podcast you don’t really need to listen to in order.</p>",
